Z||000000||fierobear||07-13-2001||12:14 PM||||I got a steering wheel from the Fiero Store, and after pulling my original one off, I discovered that you need some kind of adaptor kit or to drill out some rivets on the old one. They don't bother to give you that information, or an instruction sheet of any kind.<P>Has anyone dealt with this damn thing?||||reg||1
